mentor-element-5d044bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5d044bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>About SUBCONTRACT INDIA<span style=\"color: rgb(110, 193, 228); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\"><\/span><\/h2><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fc4bc49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fc4bc49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\">SUBCONTRACT INDIA brings together engineering manufacturers, suppliers, subcontractors, and technology innovators across key sectors such as automotive, electricals, oil &amp; gas, construction &amp; mining, industrial machinery, and medical devices.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p><p><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">With India\u2019s manufacturing ecosystem rapidly evolving and global sourcing strategies shifting toward high-performance materials and sustainable solutions, this event provides an ideal platform for us to engage with Indian OEMs, Tier 1\/2 suppliers, and supply-chain decision-makers and discover new possibilities with alumina fiber.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1e60c3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f1e60c3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e47688 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2e47688\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>How Our Solutions Align<span style=\"color: rgb(110, 193, 228); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\"><\/span><\/h2><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7fc7454 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7fc7454\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At Vulcan Shield Global, our expertise lies in developing high-performance alumina fiber products engineered to withstand extreme temperatures, corrosion, wear, and provide electrical insulation. These capabilities align closely with the needs of the industries represented at SUBCONTRACT INDIA 2025:<\/p><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Automotive &amp; EV Supply Chain: India\u2019s growing electric vehicle market demands lightweight materials with superior thermal and fire-resistant properties. Our alumina fibers are ideal for battery enclosures, thermal management systems, exhaust insulation, and electrical protection.<\/li><li>Industrial Machinery, Oil &amp; Gas, Construction &amp; Mining: These sectors operate under harsh conditions requiring components that maintain reliability and efficiency at high temperatures. Our continuous and discontinuous alumina fiber products deliver exceptional insulation, reinforcement, and durability.<\/li><li>Electricals &amp; Communication Devices: As industries advance toward higher performance and reliability, our alumina fiber materials offer excellent radio wave permeability combined with high modulus, making them suitable for structural applications that demand both strength and signal transparency.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1338b28 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1338b28\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90f881f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"90f881f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These limitations create a performance ceiling for many applications, especially when safety, weight, lifetime, and cost are also evaluated.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad88922 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ad88922\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9d8dcf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b9d8dcf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>What Vulcan Shield Global Will Showcase<span style=\"color: rgb(110, 193, 228); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\"><\/span><\/h2><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-50ffa68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"50ffa68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Visitors to our booth will be able to explore our complete portfolio of continuous and discontinuous alumina fiber products, including:<\/p><ul type=\"disc\"><li>Continuous alumina fiber solutions \u2014 yarns, sewing thread, braided rope and sleeve, woven tape, and woven fabric \u2014 delivering high tensile strength, low density, and thermal stability for reinforcement and lightweight structures.<\/li><li>Discontinuous alumina fiber solutions \u2014 bulk fiber and needled blankets \u2014 designed for high-temperature resistance, fire-safety and thermal barrier applications.<\/li><\/ul><p><br \/>Our technical specialists will be on-site to share insights, demonstrate product performance, and discuss integration into local and global manufacturing systems.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44a46be e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"44a46be\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8776a27 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8776a27\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>Drop By Our Booth <span style=\"color: rgb(110, 193, 228); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\"><\/span><\/h2><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-acb170d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"acb170d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We invite all professionals, partners, and innovators attending SUBCONTRACT INDIA 2025 to visit our booth at <strong>Hall A, H1-57<\/strong> where we will be co-exhibiting with AdiNal Engineering, our distributor in India, and learn how Vulcan Shield Global\u2019s alumina fiber technologies can enhance material performance, improve efficiency, and support a more sustainable manufacturing future.<\/p><p>Stay tuned for more updates as we prepare for the exhibition \u2014 and meet us in Pune this November to explore new possibilities in advanced materials together.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are pleased to announce that Vulcan Shield Global will be exhibiting at SUBCONTRACT INDIA 2025, the premier engineering subcontracting and sourcing event in India, taking place 6\u20138 November 2025 at the Auto Cluster Exhibition Area in Pune, Maharashtra. About SUBCONTRACT INDIA SUBCONTRACT INDIA brings together engineering manufacturers, suppliers, subcontractors, and technology innovators across key [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"cybocfi_hide_featured_image":"","footnotes":"","_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1688","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-news"],"acf":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1688","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"hr